3. **MUST NOT cordon spot-batch nodes without draining** — prevents ASG scale-up blocking

The file uses the `@runbook.md` import syntax with a **Read before:** trigger, so agents will load it when touching cluster_version or attempting EKS upgrades. It also documents the June 2024 incident as a Locked Decision to provide historical context for why these constraints exist.

